              <option value="erb_cloud_vpc">Cloud VPC &amp; Subnets (Nord Arctic)</option>
              <option value="erb_k8s">Kubernetes Cluster &amp; Namespaces (Cyan)</option>
              <option value="erb_cicd">Automated CI/CD Delivery Pipeline (Emerald)</option>
