              <option value="erb_pipeline">Data &amp; Task Pipeline (Nord Arctic)</option>
              <option value="erb_state_machine">State Transition Lifecycle &amp; FSM (Amber)</option>
              <option value="erb_records">Memory Records &amp; Data Structures (Slate)</option>
